# OpenClaw — Execution Engines (ZOA, Archon, Kairos)

## The Three Engines

| Engine | Role | Service |
|---|---|---|
| **ZOA** | Multi-LLM router + agent orchestration | `openclaw-benchmark` (FastAPI) |
| **Archon** | Skill generation workflow engine | `archon-factory` (Node.js) + `archon-zeta` (Render) |
| **Kairos** | Training job execution + governance enforcement | `openclaw-benchmark` (FastAPI) |

---

## ZOA — Multi-LLM Router

ZOA is the agent orchestration layer. It routes tasks to the right LLM based on task type.

### Router Map (100% Free Tier)

| Role | Model | Why |
|---|---|---|
| MANAGER | `meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free` | Battle-tested, proven JSON routing |
| WORKER: Research/RAG | `qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct:free` | 262K context, built for RAG |
| WORKER: Hard Reasoning | `nousresearch/hermes-3-llama-3.1-405b:free` | 405B frontier, best function calling |
| WORKER: Vision/Math | `google/gemma-3-27b-it:free` | Only real multimodal free model |
| WORKER: Write/Clinical | `cognitivecomputations/dolphin-mistral-24b-venice-edition:free` | Uncensored, no filters |
| WORKER: OCR | `baidu/qianfan-ocr-fast:free` | Purpose-built OCR |
| WORKER: Audio | `google/gemma-3n-e4b-it:free` | Only model with audio input |
| PLUMBER: Short | `liquid/lfm-2.5-1.2b-instruct:free` | 1.2B = pure throughput, format/merge |
| PLUMBER: Long | `meta-llama/llama-3.2-3b-instruct:free` | 131K context, merges long outputs |

### Plumber Selection Logic

```typescript
function selectPlumber(workerResults: WorkerResult[]): string {
  const hasImages = workerResults.some(r => r.hasImageContext);
  const totalTokens = workerResults.reduce((n, r) => n + r.outputTokens, 0);
  if (hasImages) return 'google/gemma-3-4b-it:free';
  if (totalTokens > 4000) return 'meta-llama/llama-3.2-3b-instruct:free';
  return 'liquid/lfm-2.5-1.2b-instruct:free';
}
```

### Rate Limit Fallback Chains

- vision: `gemma-3-27b → gemma-3-12b → gemma-3-4b`
- research: `qwen3-next-80b → llama-3.3-70b`
- reasoning: `hermes-405b → llama-3.3-70b` (paid fallback only if needed)

All OpenRouter calls include:
```json
{ "provider": { "sort": "throughput", "allow_fallbacks": true } }
```

### ZOA API Base

`VITE_ZOA_SERVICE_URL` / `BENCHMARK_SERVICE_URL` → `/api/v1/zoa`

