## Archon — Skill Generation Engine

Archon is the workflow engine for the Zeta Skill Forge. It generates, validates, benchmarks, and catalogs skills from plain-English prompts.

### Zeta Skill Forge Pipeline

```
prompt → generate (Qwen3 Coder 480B) → L0 validate (tsc) → fix loop (max 2) → L1-L4 benchmark → catalog
```

### Trigger

```bash
POST /archon/generate
{ "description": "Build a skill that fetches RSS headlines for a company" }
```

Or directly via Archon REST API:
```bash
POST http://archon-zeta.onrender.com/api/workflows/zeta-skill-forge/run
{ "message": "Build a skill that fetches RSS headlines for a company" }
```

### Pipeline Stages

| Stage | Action | Endpoint |
|---|---|---|
| generate | Qwen3 Coder 480B generates TypeScript skill JSON | `POST /internal/generate` |
| validate | `tsc` syntax check + export verification | `POST /internal/validate` |
| fix-loop | If L0 fails, fix and re-validate (max 2 retries) | `POST /internal/fix` |
| benchmark | L1-L4 benchmark via OpenRouter | `POST /api/v1/benchmark/run-sync` |
| catalog | If CERTIFIED/CONDITIONAL, insert into skill catalog | `POST /api/skills` |

### Archon Client (`packages/archon-factory/src/archonClient.ts`)

```typescript
triggerArchonWorkflow(workflowName, message, conversationId?) → ArchonRunResponse
getArchonRunStatus(runId) → ArchonRunStatus
```

### Environment Variables

| Variable | Description |
|---|---|
| `ARCHON_FACTORY_URL` | URL of archon-factory service |
| `BENCHMARK_SERVICE_URL` | URL of mcp-benchmarks FastAPI service |
| `OPENCLAW_API_URL` | URL of openclaw-api service |
| `OPENCLAW_SERVICE_TOKEN` | Service-to-service bearer token |

