## Kairos — Training Job Execution Engine

Kairos executes training workflows dispatched from the Model Forge. It enforces governance rules during execution.

### Kairos API Base

`KAIROS_SERVICE_URL` → `/api/v1/zoa/kairos`

### Kairos Client (`artifacts/api-server/src/lib/kairosClient.ts`)

```typescript
kairosClient.runWorkflow(req: KairosWorkflowRequest) → KairosRunResponse
kairosClient.getRunStatus(runId) → KairosRunStatus
kairosClient.getRunStreamUrl(runId) → string  // SSE stream URL
kairosClient.listRuns(skillId?, tenantId?) → { runs, total }
```

### KairosWorkflowRequest

```typescript
interface KairosWorkflowRequest {
  skill_id: string;   // "forge-job-{jobId}"
  goal: string;       // structured goal string with dataset/model/hyperparams
  tenant_id: string;
  max_turns?: number; // default 10
}
```

### KairosRunStatus

```typescript
interface KairosRunStatus {
  run_id: string;
  status: "running" | "done" | "failed";
  turn_count: number;
  tool_calls_made: number;
  violations: Array<{ tool_name: string; reason: string; benchmark_score: number }>;
  degraded: boolean;
  result: string | null;
  error: string | null;
  archon_reforge_ready: boolean;  // true if skill needs regeneration
}
```

### Job Monitor (`artifacts/api-server/src/lib/jobMonitor.ts`)

Polls Kairos run status every 30s after dispatch. On completion:
- Updates `training_jobs.status` to `completed` or `failed`
- Sets `reforge_suggested = true` if `archon_reforge_ready = true`

### Dispatch Flow

```
POST /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs/:jid/dispatch
  → assertJobStatus(job, "queued")
  → build goal string from job + dataset + version
  → kairosClient.runWorkflow(...)
  → UPDATE training_jobs SET status='running', kairos_run_id=...
  → INSERT model_usage_events (training_started)
  → jobMonitor.start(jobId, runId, tenantId, workspaceId)
```

### SSE Stream

Frontend connects directly to Kairos SSE stream via:
```
GET /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs/:jid/events
```
API server proxies the Kairos SSE stream to the client.
